---
// Page-top hairline that fills as the article is read. Ash on purpose: it is
// feedback, not an interaction, so it does not get the gold ink.
---

<div
  class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 h-[2px]"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <div data-progress class="h-full origin-left scale-x-0 bg-ash"></div>
</div>
